An '''elder (+)''' is a combat potion that boosts the player's [[Attack]], [[Strength]], and [[Defence]] levels by 6 + 16% of their base level. It can be made with 70 [[Herblore]] by using a [[golpar]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having a [[stinkhorn mushroom]] in the inventory. Making this potion gives 13 Herblore experience.

This potion is the strong variant of the elder potions, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]].
